>>__ load "simpLib";
>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `set_safe_solvers`

``` hol4
simpLib.set_safe_solvers : Traverse.ssolver list ->
  simpLib.simpset -> simpLib.simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Replaces the safe solver list, retaining only the first solver of each name.
The unsafe list is unchanged.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>>_ val ss = simpLib.add_safe_solver
     (simpLib.mk_tactic_solver ("decide", DECIDE_TAC))
     boolSimps.bool_ss;
>>_ val no_safe_solvers = simpLib.set_safe_solvers [] ss;
```

### See also

[`simpLib.add_safe_solver`](#simpLib.add_safe_solver),
[`simpLib.set_unsafe_solvers`](#simpLib.set_unsafe_solvers).
